, resulting in improved business outcomes.\n*   Improved data accuracy by 20% through process optimization.\n*   Developed automated reporting processes to reduce manual effort by 30%.\n\n**Junior Data Analyst | Beta Industries | Anytown, USA | 2018 – 2019**\n\n*   Assisted senior analysts in data collection, cleaning, and analysis.\n*   Supported the development of data visualizations and reports using Excel.\n*   Learned and applied data analysis techniques to support business decision-making.\n*   Contributed to the improvement of data quality and consistency.\n\n**Education**\n\n**Bachelor of Science in Statistics | University of California, Berkeley | Berkeley, CA | 2018**\n\n*   GPA: 3.8\n*   Relevant Coursework: Statistical Modeling, Data Mining, Database Management, Business Analytics\n\n**Certifications**\n\n*   Tableau Desktop Certified Associate\n*   Microsoft Certified: Data Analyst Associate\n\n\"", "logprobs": [{"token": "\"", "logprob": -1.1920928244535389e-07}, {"token": "\n\n", "logprob": -1.6961807012557983}, {"token": "**", "logprob": -0.0005794276366941631}, {"token": "Mat", "logprob": -4.887569048150908e-06}, {"token": "thias", "logprob": -3.325883881188929e-05}, {"token": "▁Al", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "giers", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "**", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "\n", "logprob": -1.0728830375228426e-06}, {"token": "(", "logprob": -6.282132380874828e-05}, {"token": "1", "logprob": -0.4744630455970764}, {"token": "2", "logprob": -2.3841855067985307e-07}, {"token": "3", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": ")", "logprob": -3.576278118089249e-07}, {"token": "▁", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "4", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "5", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "6", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "-", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "7", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "8", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "9", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "0", "logprob": -1.5497195136049413e-06}, {"token": "▁|", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "▁mat", "logprob": -4.327203714638017e-05}, {"token": "t